on over the 2357.18-2700.00 band."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789970399999, "market_context": {"H1": "bull trend, higher highs/higher swing lows since the 1789538400000 bar (close 2404.65) into the 2700.00 tag on 1789948800000", "H4": "current context reads a 2357.18-2700.00 trading range with a rising channel leg from 2358.62, top tested twice at 2700.00", "D1": "current context reads a bull-trend breakout-spike; bars 117-119 produced the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling", "location_at_decision": "price 2664.07 sits mid the M15 tight flag 2652.74-2673.92, just under the 2700.00 H4 range top"}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback / bull flag High 2 in the M15 tight range 2652.74-2673.92", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 closed bar 118 high, the high of the tight flag and a higher high versus bar 110 high 2673.11", "price_field": "high", "price": "2673.92", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 118, "open_time_ms": 1789968600000, "close_time_ms": 1789969499999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 closed bar 114 low, the lowest low of the tight flag / most recent higher low inside the pullback", "price_field": "low", "price": "2652.74", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 114, "open_time_ms": 1789965000000, "close_time_ms": 1789965899999}}, "evidence_for": ["H1 is a bull trend: successive higher swing lows 2413.82 (H1 low of 1789606800000), 2436.87 (H1 low of 1789689600000), 2495.82 (H1 low of 1789736400000), 2569.80 (H1 low of 1789873200000) and 2647.48 (M15 low of 1789956000000).", "M15 pullback after the 2700.00 tag (M15 bar 97 high 2700.00) held as a higher low: M15 bar 104 O2648.28 C2658.26, low 2647.48, above the H4 swing low 2641.70.", "Tight flag with rising lows: 2652.74 (M15 bar 114 low), 2658.08 (bar 116 low), 2658.08 (bar 117 low), 2663.87 (bar 119 low) inside the 2652.74-2673.92 band; a two-legged pullback that maps to a High 2 buy above the flag high.", "Bull follow-through inside the flag: M15 bar 117 O2658.89 H2671.57 C2669.18 closed at its high, and the last three closes 2669.18, 2667.79, 2664.07 hold the upper half of the flag.", "D1 context (current) shows the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling (bars 117-119 closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90) with always_in long, so the pullback is a continuation location rather than a range middle."], "evidence_against": ["The 2700.00 level has rejected twice: H1 1789808400000 O2641.94 H2700.00 C2641.14 and M15 bar 97 O2676.31 H2700.00 C2685.52, then a 52-point sell-off to 2647.48; H4 context (current) still calls 2357.18-2700.00 a trading range with the top defended.", "Trader's Equation is crowded: from trigger 2673.92 there is about 26 points to the 2700.00 double top versus about 21 points to the flag low 2652.74, so the immediate reward is only ~1.2x risk unless 2700.00 is exceeded.", "No decisive bull signal bar at the decision price: M15 bar 119 O2667.80 H2668.80 L2663.87 C2664.07 is a small doji closing in the lower half of its range, and 2664.07 is mid-flag rather than at an edge.", "The last H4 bar closed 2664.73, still 35.27 below the 2700.00 top, so no breakout acceptance is in evidence; the flag could prove to be a final flag after the 2358.62-to-2700.00 leg."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["The flag high 2673.92 has not been reached; the stop is pending and may never trigger.", "The tight range is unresolved and could break either way; the overhead 2700.00 double top may cap the first breakout attempt.", "The H4 bar containing the final H1 bars is still forming, so current H4 structure is incomplete.", "Optional volume was available but not used as evidence; no conclusion is drawn from it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["Two consecutive M15 closes above 2700.00 would confirm breakout acceptance and shift the read toward D1 bull-trend continuation targeting the 2771 spike high.", "M15 closes back below 2652.74 and then 2647.48 would invalidate the bull flag and support rotation toward 2569.80 and 2495.82.", "Another bear reversal bar rejecting 2700.00 and closing back below 2641.70 would restore the H4 range-top read and favor two-sided rotation over the 2357.18-2700.00 band."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1789948799999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["Window opens at 2116.86 and falls to 1368.42 (bar 13 low, close 1568.55), then reverses; final close 2642.90 is about +24.9% versus the first open and about +93% above the window low.", "Bars 87-89 are the spike: 1916.51 to 2252.16, 2252.20 to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "evidence_against": ["The breakout is only three bars; the preceding 27 bars overlap heavily and the region 2357-2557 can still be read as the operating trading range rather than broken.", "Two earlier upside probes failed to hold: bar 110 high 2680 closed 2514.72, bar 113 high 2609.02 closed 2514.07, so upside spikes in this region have recently been rejected.", "2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the whole post-spike section can be read as one broad trading range whose upper extreme has not been exceeded.", "Bar 119 makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700) with a lower tail to 2568.16, a pause rather than a strong continuation bar, and bar 114 had just traded down to 2358.62 four bars before the breakout."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1789971839999, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-3"], "reason": "A single MAIN long (wf-main-3, 0.229 ETH-USDT) was just filled at 2674.807454 with the executor-configured stop 2652.74 matching the documented structural invalidation (M15 bar 114 low 2652.74) and a target of 2718.14; hedge_state is single_main/unresolved=false, margin_health is SAFE, and strategy_stop_required is false, so the empty protective_order_ids is policy-compliant and no management condition is unmet. The documented bull-flag High 2 premise is neither contradicted nor invalidated by the supplied bars, so hold rather than intervene.", "evidence": {"observations": ["Position wf-main-3 LONG 0.229 ETH-USDT, ownership_role MAIN, entry 2674.807454, mark 2674.54, unrealized PnL -0.061246966; quantity is coherent across the position, the fill (wf-fill-5, 0.229 @ 2674.807454) and hedge_state.main_size.", "hedge_state: structure_status single_main, unresolved false, hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, net_exposure = gross_exposure = 612.46966 USD on absolute_mark_notional.", "Executor wf-exec-5 status RUNNING with config stop_price 2652.74 and target_price 2718.14, matching the recorded invalidation (M15 bar 114 low 2652.74) and target.", "open_orders is empty, so no resting protective order is visible in this snapshot even though the executor config carries the stop.", "management_policy brooks-pm-v1: strategy_stop_required=false, allowed actions include HOLD/REDUCE/CLOSE/hedges/REQ_ANALYSIS/RECONCILE_STATE; protection_semantics state PM decisions are advisory and only the deterministic GM writes to the venue.", "margin_health SAFE with equity 9987.69 and available margin 9865.20; position notional ~612.47 USD is about 6.1% of equity."], "evidence_for": ["The configured stop 2652.74 is exactly the recorded structural invalidation, so the management plan still maps to the original premise.", "Filled entry 2674.807454 is at/just above the flag high 2673.92, so the trade is positioned at the premise's trigger rather than mid-range.", "Structure is clean (single_main, no orphan/duplicate legs) and margin is SAFE, so HOLD carries no unmet protection or account condition under strategy_stop_required=false.", "Supplied structure shows rising swing lows into the flag (2647.48, then 2652.74/2658.08/2663.87) with the last flag closes holding roughly the upper half, i.e. no sustained opposing pressure or structural failure is yet in evidence."], "evidence_against": ["The 2700.00 level has rejected twice (H1 high 2700.00; M15 bar 97 high 2700.00 with a 52-point sell-off to 2647.48), so reward from the trigger is roughly 26 points against ~22 points of risk - a thin Trader's Equation.", "The last pre-trigger signal bar (M15 bar 119) was a small doji closing in the lower half of its range, and the H4 context still reads 2357.18-2700.00 as a trading range, so the flag could be a final flag.", "No protective order appears in open_orders; if the executor-config stop is not actually registered at the venue, the position would be unprotected in practice."]}, "risk": {"exposure_b